  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "アカデミー指定の　ボール。　普通サイズ。エンブレムの位置を　ぴったり　蹴るとまっすぐ飛ぶと　信じている　生徒も多い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "보통 사이즈의 아카데미 지정 볼. 엠블럼 위치를 정확하게 차면 똑바로 날아간다고 믿는 학생이 많다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "學院指定的球。一般尺寸。許多學生相信，若精準踢中校徽的位置，球將會筆直地飛出去。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ballon distribué par l’académie, de taille moyenne. Beaucoup d’élèves pensent qu’il faut le taper juste sur le blason de l’académie pour le faire voler droit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der offizielle Akademie-Ball in der Standardgröße. Viele Schüler glauben, er fliege in gerader Linie, wenn man gegen das darauf abgebildete Akademie-Wappen tritt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La pelota oficial de la academia, de tamaño medio. Muchos estudiantes creen que, para que vaya en línea recta, hay que patearla justo en el centro del escudo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Palla con il design regolamentare dell’accademia. È di misura media. Molti studenti credono che se la calci esattamente sull’emblema volerà dritta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The academy’s standard-issue ball in a regulation size. Lots of students believe that if you kick it right on the academy emblem, it’ll fly in a straight line.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "アカデミー指定の　ボール。　普通サイズ。エンブレムの位置を　ぴったり　蹴るとまっすぐ飛ぶと　信じている　生徒も多い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "学院指定的球。普通尺寸。有很多学生相信只要完美踢中勋章的部分，就能让球笔直飞出。",
